  "description": "ZOKCAG crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C136 H104 N12 O16 Tb4,2(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Tb2 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb5 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.574-3.906 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.03-110.85°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C140H110Tb4N14O16.",
